sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Caller as Future endpoint / trusted caller
 participant S as leave_party (implemented)
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Note over Caller,DB: Baseline e0edf10: service merged, HTTP route/UI still pending Task70/US4 frontend
 Caller->>S: party_id and trusted user from guard
 S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party
 alt Party missing
 S-->>Caller: NOT_FOUND 404, rollback
 else Party found
 alt User is Host
 S-->>Caller: HOST_CANNOT_LEAVE 403, rollback
 else Non-Host
 S->>DB: Lock own membership
 alt No membership
 S-->>Caller: NOT_MEMBER 403, rollback
 else Already left
 S->>DB: End transaction without UPDATE
 S-->>Caller: Original membership and left_at (even after start/cancellation)
 else Active membership
 S->>S: Reject cancelled first, read clock after locks, require now before starts_at
 alt Cancelled or started
 S-->>Caller: PARTY_CANCELLED / PARTY_STARTED 409, rollback
 else Allowed
 S->>DB: UPDATE left_at only
 alt Write fails
 S->>DB: ROLLBACK
 S-->>Caller: Database error, no partial mutation
 else Success
 S->>DB: COMMIT
 S-->>Caller: Membership with left_at
 end
 end
